WEBVTT

00:01.042 --> 00:03.253
HINAGIKU

00:03.670 --> 00:05.964
You guys, good job on the mission.

00:06.047 --> 00:07.382
And now...

00:10.468 --> 00:16.349
let the Hinagiku Hot Pot begin!

00:17.475 --> 00:20.103
Mission accomplished! Casualties, zero!

00:20.186 --> 00:21.980
You did great, Taiyo!

00:22.063 --> 00:23.606
Go on. Eat your fill!

00:23.690 --> 00:26.109
Mmm.

00:26.860 --> 00:27.861
Wh-What's this?

00:28.361 --> 00:29.821
It's a Hinagiku Hot Pot.

00:30.238 --> 00:32.824
It's an event the chief throws
to thank her subordinates

00:32.907 --> 00:35.368
with various foods that she's
gathered with her bare hands.

00:35.452 --> 00:37.746
What should we start with?

00:37.829 --> 00:39.247
Her bare hands?

00:40.415 --> 00:43.835
Seems like someone I didn't even invite
weaseled his way in.

00:44.377 --> 00:46.838
I won't let you take issue
with my chaperoning Mutsumi.

00:46.921 --> 00:48.214
Get lost, sister-lover.

00:48.298 --> 00:50.008
I'll be happy to leave,

00:50.091 --> 00:53.595
but I'll be taking this specially brewed
Yozakura Blizzard sake with me.

00:53.678 --> 00:55.597
I'll make an exception
this one time.

00:56.514 --> 00:58.266
I will slice them into bite-sized morsels.

00:58.349 --> 00:59.476
Please step back.

01:00.810 --> 01:02.645
Narcissus-style Sword Skill...

01:04.355 --> 01:05.356
Peony.

01:11.196 --> 01:12.405
Looks about ready.

01:16.159 --> 01:17.160
Here, Mutsumi.

01:18.078 --> 01:19.496
Thank you, Taiyo!

01:26.461 --> 01:28.630
Taiyo?

01:28.713 --> 01:32.133
Who gave you the right to portion out food
for Mutsumi? Try again in 1,000 years!

01:32.217 --> 01:35.011
All right, Mutsumi,
here's Big Bro's ultimate selection--

01:35.637 --> 01:38.223
Stop being a meddlesome in-law!

01:40.725 --> 01:44.104
Are you that eager to become part
of that stew, Rin Fudo?

01:55.073 --> 01:57.242
There you go again! Just stop it, already!

01:57.742 --> 02:00.370
I think the meat's just about ready.

02:00.453 --> 02:01.996
Don't jump the gun, Oga!

02:04.374 --> 02:06.292
They got him with a fishcake?

02:11.297 --> 02:14.008
The battle's so intense,
we can't get near the hot pot.

02:14.092 --> 02:16.177
At this rate, we'll never get to eat!

02:18.721 --> 02:21.766
If the attacks aren't meant for us,
dodging them is child's play.

02:28.064 --> 02:29.149
Picking Flowers.

02:32.193 --> 02:33.903
A variation on Walking on Flowers.

02:33.987 --> 02:36.114
Wow! Thank you, Sui!

02:36.197 --> 02:37.699
Hey, thanks.

02:39.784 --> 02:42.120
Walking on Flowers
will warp an amateur's bones.

02:42.954 --> 02:45.165
Carelessly imitating it
will wreck your body.

02:46.249 --> 02:48.668
Build up your energy,
and keep plugging away at it.

02:49.169 --> 02:50.170
Sui...

02:51.337 --> 02:53.047
God, that's hot!

02:53.131 --> 02:54.424
Never let your guard down.

02:54.507 --> 02:55.925
The pot is a battlefield.

03:06.769 --> 03:13.359
YOZAKURA FAMILY

04:32.981 --> 04:35.566
PLAN 10
THE YOZAKURA FAMILY MAID / AFFAIR

04:36.693 --> 04:38.069
I'm going to use the facilities.

04:38.569 --> 04:40.196
It's in the back on the left.

04:41.364 --> 04:43.825
Rin and Oga, you wake up, too!

04:45.201 --> 04:46.577
I can't eat any more.

04:49.914 --> 04:54.460
I'll tell you all
that I know about your family.

04:57.088 --> 04:58.381
<i>This contains...</i>

04:58.715 --> 05:00.133
<i>information about my family.</i>

05:03.428 --> 05:05.888
Young man in the throes of anxiety...

05:05.972 --> 05:07.265
Whoa!

05:07.348 --> 05:08.725
Ohh! Ahh!

05:08.808 --> 05:10.018
Are you okay?

05:10.101 --> 05:11.644
You're looking really pale.

05:12.145 --> 05:15.106
Mostly due to
what you just did, I think.

05:16.566 --> 05:21.279
Is that the thing containing
some kind of information on your family?

05:22.572 --> 05:23.781
Aren't you going to open it?

05:23.865 --> 05:26.242
I'm afraid.

05:26.326 --> 05:28.870
I feel like if I open it,
everything's going to change.

05:30.330 --> 05:34.167
When I stopped Kurogao,
my body sprang into action right away.

05:34.625 --> 05:37.837
<i>But for a split second,
another thought crossed my mind.</i>

05:39.005 --> 05:42.842
<i>If the person who took my family from me
was right before my eyes,</i>

05:42.925 --> 05:44.594
<i>I might have done the same thing.</i>

05:45.553 --> 05:47.722
A split second?
No, I'm just trying to downplay it.

05:47.805 --> 05:49.849
After all that talk
about not letting anyone die,

05:49.932 --> 05:55.480
in that moment, I was relating to someone
who wanted to kill someone else.

05:56.230 --> 05:57.231
If...

05:57.315 --> 06:00.693
when I open this box,
I find out something about my family,

06:00.777 --> 06:01.903
I might...

06:01.986 --> 06:04.155
I might end up being just like him.

06:22.006 --> 06:23.132
Oh...

06:26.928 --> 06:29.389
Oh, my! How embarrassing!

06:29.472 --> 06:31.182
M-M-M-M-Mutsumi?

06:31.265 --> 06:32.767
What's gotten into you?

06:32.850 --> 06:36.187
Oh, I just thought
we were having that kind of moment.

06:36.270 --> 06:37.730
What's that supposed to mean?

06:37.814 --> 06:39.899
But now you get it, don't you?

06:39.982 --> 06:40.983
Uh...

06:41.859 --> 06:44.362
No matter what kind of surprises
come your way,

06:44.445 --> 06:46.781
you'll always be the same you, Taiyo.

06:46.864 --> 06:51.494
And even if you do change,
I'll always be right here by your side.

06:55.581 --> 06:57.291
Thanks, Mutsumi.

06:58.042 --> 06:59.210
Hey.
- Huh?

06:59.752 --> 07:00.795
What's wrong?

07:00.878 --> 07:03.381
Look what your reaction did to the box.

07:10.471 --> 07:11.472
A marble?

07:11.556 --> 07:13.975
It uses a method
of recording optic data

07:14.058 --> 07:16.018
by arranging air bubbles with a laser.

07:16.644 --> 07:19.480
Though there are few options,
it's possible to extract the data.

07:20.523 --> 07:23.776
Why don't we record your last words, too?

07:24.444 --> 07:26.779
I'm a dead man!

07:28.990 --> 07:31.868
Don't lose your head
over a little peck, sister-lover.

07:31.951 --> 07:33.035
Both of you, run.

07:37.206 --> 07:41.419
I'll kill you all!

07:49.218 --> 07:50.803
That sure was tasty, huh?

07:51.304 --> 07:52.305
Yeah.

07:54.432 --> 07:56.809
But I'm so wiped.

07:56.893 --> 07:59.103
My whole body feels heavy.

07:59.854 --> 08:00.855
Wait.

08:02.940 --> 08:04.775
What are you doing, Ayaka?

08:05.735 --> 08:06.736
Please get off me.

08:06.819 --> 08:08.070
I can't.

08:08.154 --> 08:10.031
I'm recharging you, Master Taiyo.

08:10.114 --> 08:11.240
Recharging?

08:11.324 --> 08:13.743
Hang on, what are you doing here
in the first place?

08:15.203 --> 08:19.624
I'm here to protect you and Lady Mutsumi
from assassins, of course!

08:20.208 --> 08:21.834
What are you talking about?

08:21.918 --> 08:24.629
We've asked her to come
work for us on a live-in basis.

08:24.879 --> 08:26.422
What? Live-in?

08:26.964 --> 08:30.134
The traditional Yozakura maid costume
looks so good on you!

08:30.593 --> 08:33.471
Now, let me teach you
how to brew delicious tea.

08:33.554 --> 08:34.555
Yes, ma'am!

08:34.639 --> 08:37.767
As a spy,
of course I have assassination skills.

08:37.850 --> 08:41.521
But thanks to my undercover missions,
I'm also well-versed in housekeeping!

08:41.604 --> 08:44.899
Hold up. Is it really okay
to let an outside spy live here?

08:44.982 --> 08:46.901
Hmm...
I thought it would be okay,

08:46.984 --> 08:49.195
since it's Ayaka.
You've got to be kidding me!

08:49.278 --> 08:53.074
Needless to say, you infiltrating
Kuroyuri's, that is, Kurogao's office,

08:53.157 --> 08:56.118
and, after a fierce battle,
rescuing the deputy prime minister

08:56.202 --> 08:59.622
and obtaining an optical drive--
I'm aware of it all!

08:59.705 --> 09:02.291
And this optical drive
that you retrieved...

09:03.042 --> 09:05.795
Oh...

09:07.088 --> 09:08.172
Huh?

09:08.256 --> 09:10.925
Not only is it old,
it's also a little damaged.

09:11.342 --> 09:13.970
It's going to take some time
to analyze it.

09:14.929 --> 09:16.514
When did you tell her about it?

09:16.639 --> 09:20.560
I'm a spy, after all.
I contacted her in advance.

09:21.018 --> 09:25.189
Needless to say, I also know
that your bounty has shot up!

09:25.273 --> 09:26.440
Congratulations!

09:26.524 --> 09:27.525
Not feeling it!

09:27.608 --> 09:31.821
All kinds of violence and hostile intent
are heading your way, Master Taiyo!

09:32.405 --> 09:35.074
<i>To burn, gouge, crush, and twist you.</i>

09:35.575 --> 09:39.579
It's only a matter of time before
you're reduced to a hunk of flesh!

09:39.662 --> 09:41.831
Don't get aroused
by my manner of death!

09:42.540 --> 09:46.419
If you hope to preserve your wedded bliss,
you need to protect yourself.

09:46.752 --> 09:47.753
And so...

09:48.170 --> 09:50.756
in order to boost
your anti-assassin skills,

09:50.840 --> 09:52.883
I'm going to assassinate you
on a regular basis.

09:52.967 --> 09:54.719
After all, I am a spy!

09:55.720 --> 09:59.015
A-Are you really sure about this, Mutsumi,
having Ayaka in the house?

10:00.016 --> 10:02.143
Well, since it's for your own good, Taiyo.

10:03.185 --> 10:06.188
What?

10:07.023 --> 10:11.986
YOZAKURA FAMILY

10:15.740 --> 10:17.992
I'm wiped out again today.

10:19.493 --> 10:20.995
Thank you for your hard work.

10:27.001 --> 10:29.545
Big Bro Kyoichiro's out of tea leaves?

10:29.629 --> 10:31.964
Too bad. They're the best pick-me-up.

10:33.049 --> 10:34.675
I'll go with Nanao's blend of tea.

10:42.850 --> 10:44.602
I'm going to take a bath and hit the sack.

10:45.102 --> 10:46.395
You don't want your tea?

10:47.104 --> 10:48.105
Thanks.

10:48.189 --> 10:49.315
I'll have it later.

10:57.823 --> 10:58.824
I see.

10:58.908 --> 10:59.950
Tea, huh?

11:01.702 --> 11:04.914
Don't ever let your guard down, especially
when you're vulnerable in the bath!

11:04.997 --> 11:07.625
There she is!

11:09.001 --> 11:10.294
Stop that snapping!

11:10.378 --> 11:12.588
Now, then, protect yourself,

11:12.672 --> 11:13.756
Master Taiyo!

11:14.340 --> 11:17.218
Whoa! That was close!

11:28.896 --> 11:30.690
Uh?

11:32.483 --> 11:34.276
The electric bath trap's been activated!

11:34.568 --> 11:35.861
I'll save you now!

11:36.821 --> 11:40.408
You mustn't. If you get electrocuted,
you won't be able to move.

11:41.283 --> 11:44.036
I don't want to drag you
into this, Master Taiyo.

11:44.537 --> 11:45.746
Please make a run for it!

11:45.830 --> 11:47.206
I could never do that--

11:48.082 --> 11:50.459
Wait, the main power source
is in the wall, right?

11:52.253 --> 11:54.255
No way! Master Taiyo!

12:21.073 --> 12:24.827
Nothing wrong with training, but that's
as reckless as you should get, okay?

12:25.453 --> 12:26.620
Master Taiyo...

12:29.582 --> 12:31.792
Despite having Mutsumi
as your wife,

12:31.876 --> 12:35.296
you would invite another woman into
the house and frolic with her while naked?

12:35.379 --> 12:38.507
Huh? Big Bro Kyo...

12:38.591 --> 12:41.260
ichiro...

12:41.343 --> 12:42.595
I-It's not what you--

12:42.678 --> 12:44.805
By the way,
this is a torture device made

12:44.889 --> 12:47.975
by the Yozakuras during the Edo period,
Stomach Splitter.

12:48.517 --> 12:51.270
Wouldn't you like to experience
how it's used,

12:51.353 --> 12:53.230
Taiyo Asano?

12:57.401 --> 12:59.403
You don't have to run!

12:59.487 --> 13:03.073
Master Taiyo!

13:04.992 --> 13:07.870
At least let me put on my underwear.

13:07.953 --> 13:09.288
Master Taiyo! Master Taiyo!

13:09.371 --> 13:12.666
Looks like Ayaka's
part of the Yozakura family already.

13:20.341 --> 13:23.928
Let's see.
Today's missions are to make contact

13:24.011 --> 13:25.262
and then go to the location...

13:27.056 --> 13:28.057
Taiyo!

13:28.140 --> 13:30.184
You forgot your phone! Oh.

13:30.267 --> 13:32.186
KAORU
SLIDE TO ANSWER

13:32.561 --> 13:34.104
Someone named Kaoru--

13:35.523 --> 13:36.649
You don't need to get that?

13:36.732 --> 13:38.567
Oh, it's fine, just fine.

13:38.651 --> 13:39.652
I'll be going now!

13:42.488 --> 13:44.114
Signs of cheating...

13:45.616 --> 13:47.326
Don't startle me like that!

13:47.868 --> 13:50.704
Despite having someone like you,
Lady Mutsumi...

13:51.205 --> 13:53.499
Master Taiyo, why?

13:53.582 --> 13:57.044
What are you talking about?
I'm sure he's busy with his missions.

13:58.629 --> 13:59.630
But...

14:00.422 --> 14:02.591
<i>he showers before
coming home in the morning.</i>

14:03.384 --> 14:06.095
<i>He turns off his phone,
concealing his location.</i>

14:06.387 --> 14:08.305
<i>He goes off on his own
for unknown reasons.</i>

14:08.639 --> 14:10.474
<i>Then escapes!</i>

14:10.558 --> 14:12.935
Signs of cheating!

14:13.018 --> 14:14.770
Oh, Ayaka...

14:23.404 --> 14:25.531
Such a great day for a walk, isn't it?

14:27.366 --> 14:30.703
Taiyo, you know how you've
been running around like crazy lately?

14:30.786 --> 14:32.288
I heard about it from Ayaka, too.

14:32.371 --> 14:33.998
I-It's nothing.

14:34.874 --> 14:38.252
So I'm glad I get to spend
some quality time with you!

14:39.920 --> 14:42.006
Goliath sure looks happy, too.

14:42.381 --> 14:44.758
So you're in charge of walking him, huh?

14:44.842 --> 14:48.137
Because Goliath refuses to go on walks
with anyone but the head.

14:48.220 --> 14:49.597
Refuses?

14:50.306 --> 14:53.392
Goliath's a wolf-dog,
a special breed that was produced

14:53.475 --> 14:57.104
through repeated modifications
since the mid-Edo period.

14:57.438 --> 14:58.814
Huh?

15:02.568 --> 15:03.569
What?

15:03.652 --> 15:04.904
Did he get bigger?

15:04.987 --> 15:06.739
He's an elite breed of guard dog...

15:06.822 --> 15:08.574
...boasting a durable body and longevity.

15:09.116 --> 15:10.326
<i>According to the records,</i>

15:10.409 --> 15:13.287
<i>he's been serving us since
my great-great-grandmother's generation.</i>

15:15.873 --> 15:18.083
He's unbelievably strong,
you see.

15:18.375 --> 15:21.128
Want to hop on, too, Taiyo?
He can easily handle the two of us.

15:21.211 --> 15:22.212
Uh...

15:22.296 --> 15:24.048
Pardon me...

15:25.174 --> 15:26.175
Oh.

15:28.344 --> 15:30.262
You sure are strict, Goliath!

15:30.346 --> 15:32.765
Not even my husband can ride you.

15:32.848 --> 15:34.475
Sorry, Taiyo!

15:34.558 --> 15:36.769
He's loyal to his mistress,

15:36.852 --> 15:38.479
so that's a good thing.

15:38.562 --> 15:39.563
Hmm...

15:40.064 --> 15:42.316
Okay, then, Taiyo,
take his leash, and follow along.

15:42.650 --> 15:45.235
Follow along? What do you mean?

15:45.319 --> 15:46.320
Why...

15:46.403 --> 15:47.905
Goliath's walk, of course!

15:50.449 --> 15:54.536
What?

16:18.852 --> 16:20.688
Taiyo, are you all right?

16:21.188 --> 16:23.273
I-It's no biggie.

16:24.191 --> 16:25.567
Wow!

16:25.651 --> 16:27.611
So huge!

16:27.695 --> 16:29.071
He won't bite?!

16:29.154 --> 16:30.823
Wow!

16:35.619 --> 16:36.912
Hi!

16:36.996 --> 16:38.706
Mutsumi.

16:39.748 --> 16:41.208
So cool!

16:55.431 --> 16:57.599
Th-Thank you, miss.

16:57.683 --> 17:00.686
No, no. It's Goliath
you should thank--

17:04.648 --> 17:07.568
Is everyone okay?

17:10.404 --> 17:12.656
How dare someone do that to my Taiyo!

17:12.740 --> 17:15.409
Whoa, what...

17:15.701 --> 17:16.952
Goliath!

17:31.425 --> 17:32.593
Wh-Where's he going?

17:33.093 --> 17:36.638
If we analyze the logs from
the detonator attached to the balloon

17:36.722 --> 17:39.433
<i>using Big Sis Shion's machine,</i>

17:39.516 --> 17:41.643
<i>we can reverse-access the transmitter.</i>

17:43.687 --> 17:47.149
Ha! Well, well,
head of the Yozakura family!

17:47.232 --> 17:49.151
Who knew that I'd see you alive?

17:49.651 --> 17:51.236
<i>A crude gas bomb.</i>

17:51.320 --> 17:53.655
<i>A slipshod plan
affecting bystanders as well.</i>

17:53.739 --> 17:55.574
<i>You're a third-rate assassin, I see.</i>

17:55.657 --> 17:58.452
Says the leader in name only!
My, how arrogant!

18:01.038 --> 18:04.458
<i>True, I'm just a figurehead
with no powers of my own.</i>

18:04.583 --> 18:05.584
HAPPY'S SEWER HIDEOUT

18:05.667 --> 18:07.461
<i>But I won't let anyone</i>

18:07.544 --> 18:09.171
<i>get away with hurting my family.</i>

18:09.838 --> 18:11.423
<i>Always keep this in mind...</i>

18:11.882 --> 18:14.384
<i>the terror of antagonizing
the Yozakura family.</i>

18:23.060 --> 18:24.186
Are you all right?

18:24.686 --> 18:26.188
I'm telling you, it's no big deal.

18:26.271 --> 18:27.272
Thanks.

18:30.567 --> 18:32.820
Crap! I've got to get back to the house!

18:32.903 --> 18:34.196
What's wrong?

18:34.279 --> 18:35.280
What?

18:35.364 --> 18:37.032
Well, it's just...

18:39.701 --> 18:40.953
I get it.

18:41.286 --> 18:42.287
Goliath.

18:42.621 --> 18:44.706
Take us back to the house, will you?

18:49.336 --> 18:51.046
Whoa!

18:54.007 --> 18:56.426
A-Are you sure about taking me, too?

19:10.023 --> 19:12.693
Thank goodness! I made it in time.

19:12.776 --> 19:14.486
Signs of cheating!

19:17.656 --> 19:20.159
Ayaka! It's not what you think!

19:24.872 --> 19:26.832
Still making excuses?

19:28.834 --> 19:29.835
That's...

19:30.294 --> 19:32.504
Cheating?
Can't let that one go.

19:37.009 --> 19:39.845
Evil must be subjected
to swift punishment.

19:40.345 --> 19:41.346
Run, Taiyo!

19:45.392 --> 19:46.727
Please excuse us.

19:53.942 --> 19:55.068
Who are you?

19:55.444 --> 19:59.239
I am Momiji Akikaze, a member of Hinagiku.

19:59.740 --> 20:02.159
I have come to deliver a package
to Master Taiyo.

20:02.659 --> 20:03.702
Hinagiku?

20:04.203 --> 20:07.873
Hey, we agreed on a secret handover
so no one would know.

20:08.207 --> 20:11.627
No, I thought it would be better
for everyone to know.

20:12.211 --> 20:16.131
I was advised not to let
any unfortunate misunderstandings occur.

20:16.215 --> 20:18.383
Glad to see that we got here in time.

20:18.884 --> 20:21.053
It's just like you said,
Grandfather Kaoru.

20:22.888 --> 20:23.889
KAORU
SLIDE TO ANSWER

20:24.223 --> 20:26.016
Grandfather Kaoru?

20:26.099 --> 20:28.393
I am her grandfather, Kaoru Akikaze.

20:28.477 --> 20:31.605
After several exchanges with Master Taiyo
for the last few days,

20:31.688 --> 20:34.566
I was finally able to obtain this item.

20:35.317 --> 20:37.486
The rare tea leaves, Dark Sweet.

20:37.569 --> 20:40.489
It's Mr. Kyoichiro's favorite tea.

20:42.908 --> 20:45.661
Big Bro Kyoichiro's out of tea leaves?

20:45.744 --> 20:48.247
Too bad.
They're the best pick-me-up.

20:48.872 --> 20:50.374
<i>Dark Sweet.</i>

20:50.457 --> 20:54.044
<i>Because it's made of tea leaves that are
also the raw ingredients for a narcotic,</i>

20:54.127 --> 20:55.796
<i>it's extremely hard to come by.</i>

20:56.463 --> 20:59.675
<i>Even so, Master Taiyo told me
that he wished to procure it secretly</i>

20:59.758 --> 21:02.094
<i>for Mr. Kyoichiro,
who always looks out for him,</i>

21:02.177 --> 21:03.887
<i>to replenish his supply.</i>

21:04.221 --> 21:06.682
So that's what he was hiding
from Lady Mutsumi.

21:06.765 --> 21:11.687
Because if Lady Mutsumi found out, then it
wouldn't escape Master Kyoichiro's notice.

21:12.187 --> 21:13.188
Oh...

21:13.981 --> 21:15.524
Sorry, Mutsumi.

21:15.607 --> 21:17.651
I guess I made you worry for nothing.

21:18.443 --> 21:19.444
No...

21:19.528 --> 21:22.114
I'm sorry for making you
go to so much trouble.

21:22.906 --> 21:24.074
This guy...

21:24.574 --> 21:26.326
did all that just for me?

21:26.910 --> 21:29.788
<i>Despite how much I loathe and despise you?</i>

21:29.997 --> 21:31.665
For my sake?

21:40.590 --> 21:44.553
Please forgive me for doubting your love!

21:44.636 --> 21:46.888
I will atone with my life!

21:46.972 --> 21:48.849
It's okay! No need for that!

21:48.932 --> 21:50.851
You'd better apologize, too, Big Bro.

21:51.643 --> 21:53.103
I adamantly refuse.

21:54.021 --> 21:56.940
I would rather die
than apologize to that guy!

21:57.482 --> 22:00.110
Goliath, sit on Big Bro!

22:03.739 --> 22:06.658
Not apologizing, even if it kills me!

22:08.952 --> 22:10.996
- Delicious!
- Ah...

22:11.496 --> 22:16.001
Like hell, I'll apologize!

23:48.009 --> 23:50.971
NEXT TIME
